| 7 | Hub RPC/coordinator/exchange bind `127.0.0.1`; customers reach via nginx or SSH tunnel | Operational |
| 8 | Shop already forked once; follower divergence handling is new and needs soak + alerting | Operational |
| 10 | JWT for jobs is not `aitbc login`; operators scrape env files | Open |
